,["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/cn","魔法师大人，为什么盯着我的铁头瞧？"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/kr","마법사, 내 아이언 헤드는 왜 그렇게 보고 있어?"],["/interaction_records/16/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411120.json"],["/interaction_records/16/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411120.json"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/cn","呼金 & 漫漫 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/kr","후긴 & 해미 & 치피"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/cn","唔，这些熏鱼好好吃！"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/kr","오, 이 훈제 생선 진짜 맛있어!"],["/interaction_records/17/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411140.json"],["/interaction_records/17/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411140.json"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/kr","치피 & 해미"],["/interaction_records/18/preview_i18n/cn","小水村的遭遇真是令人难过。我们能不能帮忙做点什么呢？"],["/interaction_records/18/preview_i18n/kr","스몰워터 마을에서 일어난 일 때문에 마음이 아파. 우리가 도와줄 수 있는 일이 없을까?"],["/interaction_records/18/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411150.json"],["/interaction_records/18/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411150.json"],["/interaction_records/18/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/18/title_i18n/kr","해미 & 치피"],["/interaction_records/19/preview_i18n/cn","主人，漫漫，你们有看到吗？"],["/interaction_records/19/preview_i18n/kr","마스터, 해미. 혹시 보셨어요?"],["/interaction_records/19/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411160.json"],["/interaction_records/19/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411160.json"],["/interaction_records/19/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/19/title_i18n/kr","치피 & 해미"],["/interaction_records/20/preview_i18n/cn","没有人来过小水村，见到我的妈妈们后不好奇的，想问就问吧！"],["/interaction_records/20/preview_i18n/kr","스몰워터 마을에서 내 엄마들을 보고 궁금해하지 않은 사람들은 없지. 물어보고 싶으면 물어봐!"],["/interaction_records/20/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411170.json"],["/interaction_records/20/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411170.json"],["/interaction_records/20/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/20/title_i18n/kr","신밧드 & 해미"],["/interaction_records/21/preview_i18n/cn","魔法能让人死而复生吗？"],["/interaction_records/21/preview_i18n/kr","마법으로 죽은 사람을 되살릴 수 있을까?"],["/interaction_records/21/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411190.json"],["/interaction_records/21/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411190.json"],["/interaction_records/21/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅 & 满满 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/21/title_i18n/kr","소니아 & 치피 & 해미"],["/interaction_records/22/preview_i18n/cn","……真奇怪。"],["/interaction_records/22/preview_i18n/kr","...이상하네요."],["/interaction_records/22/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411210.json"],["/interaction_records/22/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411210.json"],["/interaction_records/22/title_i18n/cn","漫漫"],["/interaction_records/22/title_i18n/kr","해미"],["/interaction_records/23/preview_i18n/cn","满满捡到了很多漂亮的羽毛！"],["/interaction_records/23/preview_i18n/kr","치피가 예쁜 깃털을 주웠어요!"],["/interaction_records/23/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411220.json"],["/interaction_records/23/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411220.json"],["/interaction_records/23/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 索尼娅 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/23/title_i18n/kr","치피 & 소니아 & 해미"],["/interaction_records/24/preview_i18n/cn","我说，你干嘛拿着两片叶子来回看？在找不同？"],["/interaction_records/24/preview_i18n/kr","아니, 왜 잎사귀 두 장을 들고 그러고 있어? 다른 점을 찾고 있나?"],["/interaction_records/24/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411230.json"],["/interaction_records/24/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411230.json"],["/interaction_records/24/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 漫漫 & 路过的荧荧花"],["/interaction_records/24/title_i18n/kr","신밧드 & 해미 & Glimmerbloom"],["/interaction_records/25/preview_i18n/cn","说实话，我也不是没出过海，但这次的冒险也太不一样了！"],["/interaction_records/25/preview_i18n/kr","솔직히 말하면 나도 바다에 나가본 적은 없어. 하지만 이번 모험은 달라!"],["/interaction_records/25/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411240.json"],["/interaction_rec