iew_i18n/kr","치피, 그 검은 또 어디서 산 거야?"],["/interaction_records/30/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411300.json"],["/interaction_records/30/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411300.json"],["/interaction_records/30/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/30/title_i18n/kr","해미 & 치피"],["/interaction_records/31/preview_i18n/cn","你们知道，之前的绿水村是什么样的吗？"],["/interaction_records/31/preview_i18n/kr","이전의 그린브룩 마을이 어떤 모습이었는지 알아?"],["/interaction_records/31/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411310.json"],["/interaction_records/31/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411310.json"],["/interaction_records/31/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅 & 漫漫 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/31/title_i18n/kr","소니아 & 해미 & 치피"],["/interaction_records/32/preview_i18n/cn","漫漫，你能不能帮我研制一些可以驱逐亡灵的魔法药水？我想涂在剑上！"],["/interaction_records/32/preview_i18n/kr","해미, 그레이브본을 쫓아낼 수 있는 포션을 만들어줄 수 없어? 검에 바르고 싶어!"],["/interaction_records/32/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411330.json"],["/interaction_records/32/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411330.json"],["/interaction_records/32/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/32/title_i18n/kr","치피 & 해미"],["/interaction_records/33/preview_i18n/cn","死潮舰队留下了很多实验记录，简直是骇人听闻……"],["/interaction_records/33/preview_i18n/kr","죽음의 함대가 실험 기록을 많이 남겼어요. 정말 끔찍하네요..."],["/interaction_records/33/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411340.json"],["/interaction_records/33/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411340.json"],["/interaction_records/33/title_i18n/cn","漫漫"],["/interaction_records/33/title_i18n/kr","해미"],["/interaction_records/34/preview_i18n/cn","死潮舰队留下的实验记录，真是越看越让人心惊……"],["/interaction_records/34/preview_i18n/kr","죽음의 함대가 남긴 실험 기록은 보면 볼수록 놀라울 정도네요..."],["/interaction_records/34/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411350.json"],["/interaction_records/34/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411350.json"],["/interaction_records/34/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/34/title_i18n/kr","해미 & 소니아"],["/interaction_records/35/preview_i18n/cn","唔——唔哇啊啊！不管是什么，快出来！满满才不怕你！！"],["/interaction_records/35/preview_i18n/kr","으악, 으아아악! 뭔지는 모르겠지만 나와! 치피는 하나도 안 무서우니까!"],["/interaction_records/35/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411360.json"],["/interaction_records/35/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411360.json"],["/interaction_records/35/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/35/title_i18n/kr","치피 & 해미"],["/interaction_records/36/preview_i18n/cn","自从死潮舰队的人踏上锈锚港的那一天，我就等着把他们斩杀殆尽的这一刻。"],["/interaction_records/36/preview_i18n/kr","죽음의 함대가 러스트 항에 발을 들인 순간부터 나는 놈들을 찢어 죽일 순간을 기다려왔어."],["/interaction_records/36/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411370.json"],["/interaction_records/36/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411370.json"],["/interaction_records/36/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/36/title_i18n/kr","소니아 & 해미"],["/interaction_records/37/preview_i18n/cn","卢卡先生，你这条腰带好精致呀。"],["/interaction_records/37/preview_i18n/kr","루카 씨, 벨트가 정말 멋져요."],["/interaction_records/37/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411390.json"],["/interaction_records/37/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411390.json"],["/interaction_records/37/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 卢卡"],["/interaction_records/37/title_i18n/kr","해미 & 루카"],["/interaction_records/38/preview_i18n/cn","你既然得到了索尼娅的认可，我也会尊敬你。"],["/interaction_records/38/preview_i18n/kr","소니아의 인정을 받았으니 당신을 존중해 드리겠습니다."],["/interaction_records/38/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411410.json"],["/interaction_records/38/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411410.json"],["/interaction_records/38/title_i18n/cn","卢卡 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/38/title_i18n/kr","루카 & 해미"],["/interaction_records/39/preview_i18n/cn","你们知道，我不是个诚实的人……"],["/interaction_records/39/preview_i18n/kr","너희도 알다시피 나는 별로 정직한 사람이 아니야..."],["/interaction_records/39/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411420.json"],["/interaction_records/39/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411420.json"],["/interaction_records/39/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/39/title_i18n/kr","신밧드 & 해미"],["/interaction_records/40/preview_i18n/cn","索尼娅，击败死潮舰队，锈锚港恢复平静之后，你有什么计划呢？"],["/interaction_records/40/preview_i18n/kr","소니아, 죽음의 함대를 처치하고 러스트 항이 평화로워진 뒤에 뭘 할 생각이에요?"],["/interaction_records/40/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411430.json"],["/interaction_records/40/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411430.json"],["/interaction_records/40/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/40/title_i18n/kr","해미 & 소니아"],["/interaction_records/41/preview_i18n/cn","法拉莫尔先生，祭典结束以后，你会一直留在雪松镇吗？"],["/interaction_records/41/preview_i18n/kr","팔라모르 씨, 제전이 끝난 뒤에도 계속 시더 마을에 머무실 건가요?"],["/interaction_records/41/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep3/herohub_story/13411020.json"],["/interaction_records/41/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep3/herohub_story/13411020.json"],["/interaction_records/41/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 法拉莫尔 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/41/title_i18n/kr","해미 & 팔라모르 & 치피"],["/interaction_records/42/preview_i18n/cn","这本书里记录了一些古老的咒语，使用了诸神时代的圣书文字，有几个字我实在无法辨认。"],["/interaction_records/42/preview_i18n/kr","이 책에는 신의 시대에 사용했던 신성 문자로 적힌 오래된 주문이 있습니다. 하지만 몇 글자는 해독할 수가 없네요."],["/interaction_records/42/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep3/herohub_story/13411040.json"],["/interaction_records/42/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep3/herohub_story/13411040.json"],["/interaction_records/42/title_i18n/cn","法拉莫尔 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/42/title_i18n/kr","팔라모르 & 해미"],["/interaction_records/43/preview_i18n/cn","冬日祭典好棒啊！我还是第一次堆这么大的雪人！"],["/interaction_records/43/preview_i18n/kr","겨울 제전은 정말 좋네요! 이렇게 큰 눈사람을 만드는 건 처음이에요!"],["/interaction_records/43/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep3/herohub_story/13411050.json"],["/interaction_records/43/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep3/herohub_story/13411050.json"],["/interaction_records/43/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/43/title_i18n/kr","해미 & 치피"],["/interaction_records/44/preview_i18n/cn","真没想到，白山的活死人竟然是死神大人为了对抗恶魔而创造的亡灵战士。"],["/interaction_records/44/preview_i18n/kr","화이트마운틴의 살아있는 시체가 죽음의 신께서 악마를 대항하기 위해 만든 그레이브본 전사일 줄은 몰랐습니다."],["/interaction_records/44/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep3/herohub_story/13411060.json"],["/interaction_records/44/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep3/herohub_story/13411060.json"],["/interaction_records/44/title_i18n/cn","法拉莫尔 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/44/title_i18n/kr","팔라모르 & 해미"],["/interaction_records/45/preview_i18n/cn","格尔达女士，这次的“鬼影密室”是你设计的吗？"],["/interaction_records/45/preview_i18n/kr","게르다 부인, 이번 \"고스트 하우스\"는 당신이 디자인한 건가요?"],["/interaction_records/45/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep3/herohub_story/13411070.json"],["/interaction_records/45/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep3/herohub_story/13411070.json"],["/interaction_records/45/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 格尔达 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/45/title_i18n/kr","치피 & 게르다 & 해미"],["/interaction_records/46/preview_i18n/cn","洛桑，你怎么会跑到这里来打工呢？"],["/interaction_records/46/preview_i18n/kr","로잔, 왜 여기서 아르바이트를 하고 있는 거예요?"],["/interaction_records/46/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep3/herohub_story/13411080.json"],["/interaction_records/46/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep3/herohub_story/13411080.json"],["/interaction_records/46/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 洛桑 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/46/title_i18n/kr","해미 & 로잔 & 치피"],["/interaction_records/47/preview_i18n/cn","等打工结束我就准备离开白山，又得头疼接下来该去哪儿游历的问题了。"],["/interaction_records/47/preview_i18n/kr","일이 끝나면 화이트마운틴을 떠날 건데, 다음엔 어디로 여행을 갈지 또 고민해야겠네요."],["/interaction_records/47/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep3/herohub_story/13411100.json"],["/interaction_records/47/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep3/herohub_story/13411100.json"],["/interaction_records/47/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/47/title_i18n/kr","로잔 & 해미"],["/interaction_records/48/preview_i18n/cn","呼……呼……"],["/interaction_records/48/preview_i18n/kr","푸우… 푸…"],["/interaction_records/48/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep3/herohub_story/13411110.json"],["/interaction_records/48/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep3/herohub_story/13411110.json"],["/interaction_records/48/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 漫漫"],["/int