8n/cn","漫漫 & 斯克嘉莉德"],["/interaction_records/95/title_i18n/kr","해미 & 스칼리타"],["/interaction_records/96/preview_i18n/cn","<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，我发现了一封请柬，信里邀请我们去宴会！"],["/interaction_records/96/preview_i18n/kr","<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 초대장을 한 장 발견했어요. 우리를 연회에 초대한대요!"],["/interaction_records/96/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414080.json"],["/interaction_records/96/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn3/herohub_story/10414080.json"],["/interaction_records/96/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 萨基塔里斯"],["/interaction_records/96/title_i18n/kr","해미 & 샤키탈리스"],["/interaction_records/97/preview_i18n/cn","漫漫，有喜欢的宝石吗？喜欢哪颗就拿走吧。"],["/interaction_records/97/preview_i18n/kr","해미, 마음에 드는 보석 있어요? 있으면 하나 가져가도 좋아요."],["/interaction_records/97/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414090.json"],["/interaction_records/97/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn3/herohub_story/10414090.json"],["/interaction_records/97/title_i18n/cn","菲 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/97/title_i18n/kr","페이 & 해미"],["/interaction_records/98/preview_i18n/cn","一、二、三！怎么样，这些够了吗？"],["/interaction_records/98/preview_i18n/kr","하나, 둘, 셋! 어때요, 이 정도면 충분할까요?"],["/interaction_records/98/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414130.json"],["/interaction_records/98/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn3/herohub_story/10414130.json"],["/interaction_records/98/title_i18n/cn","卢修斯 & 漫漫 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/98/title_i18n/kr","루시우스 & 해미 & 치피"]]}